Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:55.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之金枪人》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼拿克 拿辣酱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick Nack, Tabasco!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻送来 斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, Monsieur Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的待会给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the rest later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在里面等他 从那道门进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for him in there, through that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快就跟你会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will join you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯卡曼加先生 蒸汽浴已准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your steam bath is ready, Monsieur Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样太没难度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would have been too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是锁上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要到别处找 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to look elsewhere, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, AI. AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:06:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你在哪里 别用枪指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever you are, don't hold it against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯卡曼加先生 我不知你在哪里 可以找到你的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder where you can find your gun, Monsieur Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那小金枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little golden gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在哪儿呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些是我们以前没有试过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something we haven't had before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想那会是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what it can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我耍你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fooled you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越来越接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你如何下楼梯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how are you going to get down the stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这么接近 然而又那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}So near and yet so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.73,0:07:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起 斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, Monsieur Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.41,0:08:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最好的 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one was the best, n'est-ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad. Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想要我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得有更好表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to come into my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会做到的 我会享用你留给我的每一分钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you yet, and I'll enjoy every sou you leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快累死我了 尼拿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be the death of me yet, Nick Nack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔索普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colthorpe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:11:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,参谋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 你认识一个叫 斯卡曼加的家伙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about a man called Scaramanga, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯卡曼加？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scaramanga?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指那个拥有金手枪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. The Man with the Golden Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在马戏班出生 父亲是 马戏演出指挥 大概是古巴人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born in a circus. Father, the ringmaster, possibIy Cuban.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲是英国人 玩蛇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, English, a snake charmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他十岁时已精通花式射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a spectacular trick shot artist by the time he was 10…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五岁就在里约当上枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a local Rio gunman at 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联国安会招揽他 让他在欧洲受训\N{\fnArial\fs30}The KGB recruited him there and trained him in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.49,0:11:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿 他成为一个付出多 但报酬少的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he became an overworked, underpaid assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在五十年代末期他自立门户\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went independent in the late '50s.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次行动收取一百万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Current price, $ 1 million a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案里没有他的相片\N{\fnArial\fs30}No photograph on file.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他有一个很显著的特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he does have one distinguishing feature, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个额外乳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}a superfluous papilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是乳腺\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mammary gland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三个乳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}A third nipple, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他经常使用金枪弹 所以外号是「金枪人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always uses a golden bullet, hence, Man with the Golden Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.05,0:11:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前居所不详\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present domicile unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我所知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这样问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:11:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.73,0:12:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的小装饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming trinket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even has my number on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 这子弹根本没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously it's useless as a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会付上一百万要我的性命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, sir, who would pay a million dollars to have me killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.95,0:12:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妒忌的丈夫、愤怒的厨子 受侮辱的裁缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jealous husbands, outraged chefs, humiliated tailors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说不完 而且这个小装饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The list is endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还附上一张便条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreover, this trinket, as you call it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求特别呈递给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}was sent with a note requesting special delivery to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,署名是一个「S」字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's initialed with an "S."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面的指纹已给中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scaramanga's fingerprints were on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,证实是属于斯卡曼加的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been verified by the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为何要警告我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he alert me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,心理因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychological.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想倚重自己的名声 吓怕他的受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He counts on his reputation to terrify his intended victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你撤离目前的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm relieving you of your present assignment, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:13:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,能源危机仍然没解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}The energy crisis is still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全认同找出吉勃逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respectfully submit that finding Gibson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的太阳电池数据 是现在最重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his solar cell data is even more important than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我不能祸及此事和其他任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't jeopardize it or any mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,全因为斯卡曼加突然出现射杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}by having Scaramanga pop up and put a bullet in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会批准你辞职的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll endorse your request to resign.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你可以休假躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can take a sabbatical and.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.31,0:13:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到事情解决为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}go to ground until this matter's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者直到他把我杀死为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or until he kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人知道他在哪里 或者他是什么模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows where he is or what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说他比你有优势是没错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think it's fair to assume that he has the edge on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.03,0:13:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你同意吗？没什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you agree? That's all, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我先找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I found him first, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,形势或会有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might change the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.05,0:13:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,戏剧性地变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓费尔班克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, Fairbanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉斯加？\N{\fnArial\fs30}AIaska?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是002比尔费尔班克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Bill Fairbanks, 002.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的比尔 我怀念他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, poor Bill. I miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个金枪人却不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Man with the Golden Gun didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没正式确定是他做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officially, that was never confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.91,0:14:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,事发时002在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was 002 when it happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年1969年 在贝鲁特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beirut, '69.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟一名叫萨达的女子 在夜总会内\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a cabaret with a lady called Saida.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝鲁特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beirut, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比电脑还要出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, you are better than a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在各方面都是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all sorts of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你从没好好利用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you never take advantage of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 钱班霓小姐？- 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss Moneypenny. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just one moment, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 詹姆斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, James?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不确定凶手是斯卡曼加？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wasn't Scaramanga confirmed as the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们找不到子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they couldn't find the bullet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.28,0:14:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.07,0:16:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 我叫做邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. My name is Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跳得非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dancing is superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你很帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are very handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很少会这样唐突的 但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't usually intrude like this, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我们有一个共同朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe we had a mutual friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔费尔班克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill Fairbanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,费尔班克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairbanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说在他被袭击时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm told you were with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是跟他一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he was rather rudely interrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错是比尔 那是个恐怖的晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}BiII. What a terrible night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.07,0:16:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永不会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到是谁射他的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see who shot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:16:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我在他的怀里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I was in his arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:17:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闭上了眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eyes were closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他死时快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least he died happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.03,0:17:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那颗子弹直穿过他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet went through him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过他背脊到那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through his back and ended up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 穿过他脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, through his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在警方抵达前 我把子弹从墙上取出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it out of the wall before the police arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在是我的护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it is my lucky charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有它我不会跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never dance without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信比尔会很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Bill wouId have loved that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们忘记过去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let us forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直希望你这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在贝鲁特久留吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you staying long in Beirut?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,视乎情况吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:17:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真笨拙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clumsy of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.97,0:18:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小腹真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really do have a magnificent abdomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的香水！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my perfumes! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的护身符不见了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost my charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from where I'm standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,计程车 要去饭店吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi? Hotel, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.91,0:19:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 到最近的药房去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The nearest pharmacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.08,0:20:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种改制过的子弹 在撞击时变得偏平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumdum bullets like this flatten on impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,以求达到最高的杀伤力\N{\fnArial\fs30}for maximum wounding effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是在哪里和由谁制造的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just tell me where it was made and by whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好它仍完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}FortunateIy it's all in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,20点003克\N{\fnArial\fs30}20. 003 grams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们推断 它应该由一支 4点2公厘口径的枪射出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which leads us to deduce it was fired from a 4.2 millimeter gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有4点2公厘口径的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colthorpe, there's no such thing as a 4.2 millimeter gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.06,0:20:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使没有军事 或民事的军火制造商\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that no recognized munitions manufacturer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造这样的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}military or civil, produces such a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不代表它不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean it doesn't exist, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Q」也有为特别的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q Branch have been making irreguIar calibers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而制造特别口径的手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}for most unusual purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.20,0:20:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们也没把记号或型号刻上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we don't put markings or serial numbers on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以几乎不能确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making identification almost impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法追寻那子弹的来源？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean to say there's no way to trace that bullet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道它怎样来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what it went through to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会详细覆述\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't go so far as to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我们的标准来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The workmanship is undemanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的手工不算精细\N{\fnArial\fs30}according to our standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,23开纯金混以少量镍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soft 23 karat gold with traces of nickel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧洲很少使用 是来自印度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly ever used in Europe. Comes from India.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.98,0:21:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,远东？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Far East?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.77,0:21:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不可是印度？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not India?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.31,0:21:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,镍含量明显很少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nickel content obviously too low, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉萨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lazar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.41,0:21:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.16,0:21:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满幻想力 很专业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imaginative. Highly specialized.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I concur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉萨是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what the hell is Lazar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是「什么」 是「谁」 葡萄牙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what. Who. Portuguese.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在澳门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lives in Macau.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.01,0:21:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是制造那指弹的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chap who made the bullet, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.49,0:21:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你们晚膳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to interrupt your dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.37,0:22:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉萨先生住在这儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but does Senhor Lazar live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.17,0:22:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人给我这个地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was given this address.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是否？拉萨先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he... Senhor Lazar?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫做邦德 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Bond. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.89,0:22:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到的荣幸 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unexpected honor, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,久仰大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your reputation precedes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.99,0:22:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我可以为你制造某东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be the proudest moment of my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I could make something for you, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.78,0:22:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来福枪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rifle, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.41,0:22:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个很有趣的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, here we have an interesting problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是为客人特制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A custom-built model for a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不久前失去了两只手指 请\N{\fnArial\fs30}who recently lost two fingers. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.96,0:22:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失去了扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also lost his trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.63,0:22:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它藏于枪托内 扣压它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is housed in the butt. Squeeze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.73,0:23:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准器有点偏差\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sights are a bit off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有五只手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have five fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.19,0:23:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪托是供三只手指压力平衡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The butt is balanced for the pressure of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.61,0:23:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你射低了一寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why you were one inch too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里只有精湛手艺与高质素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you will find only craftsmanship and quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.58,0:23:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那大量生产的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mass production,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.08,0:23:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,譬如你的沃尔达PPK 则留给其他人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}your Walther PPK, for instance, I leave to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么弹药呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about ammunition?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为个人要求而设计 无论要求怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Designed to individual requirements whatever they may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要用黄金打造呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In gold, if I wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替一个顾客做过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have already done that for a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.55,0:23:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.55,0:23:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗斯科斯卡曼加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francisco Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.14,0:23:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟顾客的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}My relationship with a client, Mr. Bond,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是绝对保密的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is strictly confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如一个医生 神父跟忏悔者的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a doctor or priest with a penitent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.77,0:23:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你仍然为没手指的无赖造枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you make guns for fingerless hoodlums,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.32,0:23:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为刺客制造子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}bullets for assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.07,0:24:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 子弹不会杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, bullets do not kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉扳机的人的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the finger that pulls the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.16,0:24:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.75,0:24:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正瞄准你的鼠蹊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm now aiming precisely at your groin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.38,0:24:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说 否则你要 永远拿着你那话儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So speak, or forever hold your "piece."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.88,0:24:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never seen Mr. Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.13,0:24:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以每颗子弹收费的情形下 他必定是你的最佳顾客\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a cost-per-bullet basis, he must be your best customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is true, but unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.35,0:24:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是经常开火的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he seems onIy to fire them occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.18,0:24:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次的送货 是什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last shipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.19,0:24:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 不可能的 我不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, this is impossible. I cannot...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.65,0:24:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.23,0:24:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,低了一寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}An inch too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.49,0:24:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚完成一张立刻运送的订单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just completed an order for immediate delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.20,0:24:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁去收货？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who collects them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.37,0:24:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.71,0:24:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫我送去赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}My instructions are to go the casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.25,0:24:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收了钱 他们就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am paid and they vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.60,0:25:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a few momen ts, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会抵达香港海港\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will be in Hong Kong Harbor,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.60,0:25:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是世上最繁忙的港口之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the busiest ports in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.15,0:25:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,请准备你们的护照及登陆证\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I remind you to have your passports and landing cards ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.61,0:25:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,以避免任何不必要的延误\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to avoid unnecessary delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.45,0:26:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,左手边是著名客轮 伊利沙白皇后号的残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}On our left is the wreckage of the famous liner, Queen Elizabeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在1971年在这里神秘沉下\N{\fnArial\fs30}which sank here under mysterious circumstances in 1971.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.59,0:26:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面就是九龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahead, you can now see Kowloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.38,0:26:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,右手边就是香港岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on your right, Hong Kong Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.40,0:26:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,计程车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.83,0:26:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着那辆劳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow that Rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.50,0:26:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 请你把这倒转的 便盆驶开好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, would you be good enough to move this inverted bedpan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.17,0:27:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我迟到 你在澳门的讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I'm late, James, but your signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.51,0:27:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,才刚传到办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Macau only just reached the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.01,0:27:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是好帮手 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a great help, Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.34,0:27:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去交通部查一下那辆车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get on to the license bureau and trace that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.10,0:27:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「AU603」的绿色劳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}AU603. A green Rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.02,0:27:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色劳斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A green Rolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.81,0:27:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色劳斯莱斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A green Rolls-Royce.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.77,0:27:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,香港不会有太多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can't be that many in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.11,0:27:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有绿色劳斯莱斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courtesy cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.32,0:27:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是半岛酒店的免费接客车\N{\fnArial\fs30}AII green Rolls-Royces belong to the PeninsuIa Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.57,0:27:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看两年的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what a two-year posting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.99,0:27:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对情报人员有多大转变？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Staff Intelligence does for a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.08,0:27:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, it's wonderful to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.71,0:27:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.33,0:27:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一些资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.43,0:27:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,被跟踪的目标人物 住在602号房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The subject under surveillance is occupying Room 602.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.30,0:27:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请你吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll buy you dinner tonight, Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.85,0:27:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我先要办些正经事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first I have a little official business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.35,0:27:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到那正经事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I saw the official business.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.06,0:28:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 经过这两年 我会对你那样做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, would I do that to you after two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.69,0:28:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,会 你一定会！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you bloody well wouId.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.91,0:28:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我帮你 - 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.91,0:28:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你可替我开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you could open a door for me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.17,0:28:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我替你开香槟吧？- 不 这是惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I open champagne. - It's a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.88,0:28:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是惊喜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.32,0:29:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.16,0:29:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,水枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A water pistol?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把浴袍拿给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass me that robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.30,0:29:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常带手枪沐浴的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you always take a shower with a pistol?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.77,0:30:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,举高手 离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands up and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.02,0:30:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep on walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.53,0:30:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you haven't answered my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.79,0:30:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,接待处 有什么可帮你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reception. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.38,0:30:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是602号房间的安黛拉小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Miss Anders, Room 602.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.71,0:30:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它放下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put those down!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.72,0:30:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白这些烟盒上面 为何写上政府忠告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see why these packets carry a government warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.38,0:30:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.76,0:30:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的确会危害你的健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}They certainly can damage your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.44,0:30:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄疼我的手臂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hurting my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.15,0:30:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可扭断它除非你 说出那些子弹的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll break it unless you tell me where those bullets go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.36,0:30:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.98,0:30:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,试一试！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.61,0:30:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会杀掉我！- 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll kill me. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.24,0:30:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.41,0:30:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯卡曼加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.75,0:31:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯试不就做到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what you can do when you try?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.00,0:31:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你替他工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.01,0:31:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.59,0:31:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's... I'm his...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.47,0:31:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so he's a lover, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.43,0:31:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在他杀人之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only before he kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.77,0:31:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,斗牛勇士也是那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullfighters do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.10,0:31:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说可以改善目力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claim it improves the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.81,0:31:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要杀我 我可在哪里找到他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eye is on me. Where can I find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.23,0:31:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.45,0:31:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said where?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.61,0:31:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道！他不是什么都告诉我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where. He doesn't tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.99,0:31:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今晚会在露臀夜总会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he has a date at the Bottoms Up Club tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.08,0:31:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎认得出他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will I recognize him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.41,0:31:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,高 瘦 黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tall, slim and dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.96,0:31:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那跟我的阿姨一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is my aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.50,0:31:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有任何特征吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything distinctive about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.63,0:31:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 不过我如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but how can I...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.96,0:31:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不像普通人 他有三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not like other people. He has three...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.55,0:31:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:31:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇妙的解剖学趣闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating anatomical tidbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.72,0:32:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我所听过最没用处的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}but probably the most useless piece of information I ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.81,0:32:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非露臀夜总会是 一间脱衣舞厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless of course the Bottoms Up is a strip cIub.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.73,0:32:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而斯卡曼加又在那儿表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Scaramanga is performing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.98,0:32:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要说多一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.24,0:32:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他通常穿着白色麻布西装 戴黑色领带\N{\fnArial\fs30}He usually wears a white linen suit, black tie,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.86,0:32:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,首饰全是黄金造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and jewelry, aII goId.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.99,0:32:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're improving.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.83,0:32:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你再扭我的臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to twist my arm again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.12,0:32:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.46,0:32:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着我给你的吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll tell you what you're going to do, Miss Anders.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.17,0:32:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿那些金子弹给斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to take those golden bullets to Mr. Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.01,0:32:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿不到子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}because if he doesn't get them,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.68,0:32:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会在露臀夜总会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}he may not show up at the Bottoms Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.05,0:32:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那里看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.77,0:32:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何相信我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.89,0:32:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.14,0:32:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过若斯卡曼加听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But neither will Mr. Scaramanga trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.19,0:32:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的对话他也不会相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he hears about this interesting little conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.69,0:32:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁晓得？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.19,0:32:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他或会用一颗金子弹对付你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may even use one of those little golden bullets on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.86,0:33:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就太可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that would be a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.03,0:33:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为子弹非常贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they're very expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.04,0:33:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拿给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take them to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.04,0:33:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's drink to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.80,0:33:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.93,0:33:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏打还是姜汁汽水？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soda or ginger ale?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.14,0:33:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳烦你 姜汁汽水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ginger ale, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.83,0:35:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！把枪放下！放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police! Drop it! Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.75,0:36:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已被逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.84,0:36:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走近！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.89,0:36:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查那把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you take the trouble to examine that gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.48,0:36:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没开过火的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll notice it hasn't been fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.02,0:36:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何话要说 到了警局再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you have to say, you can say at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.28,0:36:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以第473条例控告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm charging him under Section 473.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.38,0:36:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到你的工作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see your identity card.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.42,0:36:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会就会看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.11,0:37:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是到警局吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. I thought we were going to the police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.40,0:37:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,到九龙那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kowloon side.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.05,0:38:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,九龙在那边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kowloon's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.13,0:38:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去新界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to the New Territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.76,0:39:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 邦德指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard, Commander Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.77,0:39:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.40,0:39:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请走到舱口下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down the hatchway, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.12,0:40:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.04,0:40:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you follow me, pIease?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.42,0:40:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它肯定给你一个新的倾向吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. It certainly gives you a new slant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.43,0:40:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,附近有中国舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}What with the Chinese on one side.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.93,0:40:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有美国舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the American fleet on the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.39,0:40:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,香港只有这地方是不会被窃听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}down here's the only place in Hong Kong you can't be bugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.02,0:40:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,以香港现在的房地产价格来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, with current real estate prices in Hong Kong,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.23,0:40:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是蛮便宜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}quite practical, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.64,0:40:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.35,0:40:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打捞到的中国战机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chinese fighter we managed to salvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.20,0:40:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.33,0:40:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你仍与我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to see you're still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.96,0:40:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你将来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In future, Commander Bond, if you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.96,0:40:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去游览绿灯户\N{\fnArial\fs30}tour the world of Suzie Wong by night,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.51,0:40:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请通知我们的手下 赫副官\N{\fnArial\fs30}kindly inform our man here, Lieutenant Hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.80,0:41:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.18,0:41:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你摆脱香港警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to get you away from the Hong Kong police.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.10,0:41:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但又不知道你掌握了多少情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}but didn't know how much you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.18,0:41:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不知道 但我应报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. But I think I should report, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.64,0:41:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯卡曼加不是要暗杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Scaramanga does not have a contract on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.94,0:41:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今晚有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't have missed me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.15,0:41:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他杀了一个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead he hit some chap coming out of a club.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.07,0:41:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那是谁后 使我颇惊讶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got quite a shock when I saw who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.99,0:41:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也料到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should think you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.49,0:41:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们失踪了的 太阳能源专家吉勃逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our missing solar energy expert, Gibson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.66,0:41:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Gibson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.33,0:41:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本来准备在某种情形下回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was prepared to come back under certain conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.58,0:41:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才与费雷泽教授在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm out here with Professor Frazier.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.17,0:41:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫副官在进行初步接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Hip was making a preliminary contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.05,0:41:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想让斯卡曼加暗杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost wish that Scaramanga had a contract on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.22,0:41:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉勃逊合作吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was Gibson cooperative?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.68,0:41:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要求豁免权\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to bargain for immunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.60,0:41:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他提议到曼谷商讨细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suggested another meeting in Bangkok to discuss terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.23,0:41:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何选择曼谷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why Bangkok?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.43,0:41:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像在当地为海发办事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the impression he worked there for Hai Fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.06,0:41:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾听过这名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That name's come up before.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.31,0:41:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是亿万富翁\N{\fnArial\fs30}A multimillionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.73,0:41:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海发企业的主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head of Hai Fat Enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.86,0:41:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我们所知 全都是合法生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them legitimate as far as we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.99,0:42:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉勃逊用什么来讲条件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Gibson propose bargaining with, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.07,0:42:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳能感应器 声称95%有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}A solex. Claimed it was 95% efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.53,0:42:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他能发明那样有效能的电池 就能解决能源危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he developed a solar cell that efficient, he solved the energy crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.41,0:42:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已告诉过我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.37,0:42:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,煤和石油迟早会用尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coal and oil will soon be depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.38,0:42:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,铀又太危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uranium's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.21,0:42:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,地热和潮水控制太昂贵 我很清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geothermal and tidal control too expensive. I know all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.09,0:42:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳能感应器现在在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the solex now?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.72,0:42:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是太阳能感应震动器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solex agitator, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.68,0:42:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是把太阳光线转变为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The essential unit to convert radiation from the sun into electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.47,0:42:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,工业用的电力的重要东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}on an industrial basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.22,0:42:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only about that size.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.85,0:42:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就可以知道那是否有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't take me long to check out Gibson's efficiency claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.27,0:42:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真叫人兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.27,0:42:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以看看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I see it, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.27,0:42:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾在酒吧拿给我看 但又放回口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He showed it to me at the bar and replaced it in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.70,0:42:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而当他被杀后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after he was shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.12,0:42:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.37,0:42:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.50,0:42:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}M: Gentlemen, I congratulate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.96,0:42:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为可以得到一个 改良了的太阳能感应器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of getting our hands on a perfected solex,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.38,0:42:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还只得一条没用的尸体 毫无线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're left with a useless corpse and no leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.46,0:43:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}One lead, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.97,0:43:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设吉勃逊被斯卡曼加所杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assuming Gibson was killed by Scaramanga,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.97,0:43:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,聘用他的能付上一百万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever hired him could afford a million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.51,0:43:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指海发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you suggesting Hai Fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.35,0:43:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有这财力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.35,0:43:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他来说是小数目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of petty cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.98,0:43:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thought has just occurred to me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.02,0:43:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果海发聘用斯卡曼加\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Hai Fat hired Scaramanga,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.90,0:43:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该不会亲自跟他见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's highly unlikely that he met him personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.65,0:43:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.82,0:43:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,若出了任何状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the event of anything going wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.16,0:43:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没什么可把他们连在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing to connect the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.32,0:43:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我想到可如何走近他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that gives me an idea as to how to approach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.54,0:43:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 我需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q, I'll need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.33,0:43:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 007！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, 007!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.21,0:43:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认这有点怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admit, it's a little kinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.92,0:43:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带晚安一起去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll take Miss Goodnight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.84,0:43:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.01,0:43:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过今晚的失败后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After tonight's debacle,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.01,0:43:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有效率的联络官 是不会有错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}an efficient liaison officer wouldn't come amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.60,0:43:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.39,0:43:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能接近海发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get anywhere near Hai Fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.06,0:43:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有亲杯在曼谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some relatives in Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.77,0:44:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常经过他的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have often passed his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.52,0:44:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他住在山边一所大屋内 守卫森严\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives in a big house on a mountainside surrounded by guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.20,0:44:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.74,0:44:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place is crawling with guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.37,0:44:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.37,0:45:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,海发很重视私隐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hai Fat takes his privacy very seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.25,0:45:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定他会见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he'll see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.45,0:45:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 水怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. How's the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.70,0:45:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你不下水看看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come in and find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.95,0:45:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎很吸引 小姐是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds very tempting, Miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.45,0:45:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,赵美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chew Mee.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.91,0:45:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.83,0:45:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's only one small problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.71,0:45:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有游泳裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no swimming trunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.42,0:45:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.63,0:45:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}HAI FAT: What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.43,0:45:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.14,0:45:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻滚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.81,0:45:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have you...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.82,0:46:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅 斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, forgive me, Mr. Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.66,0:46:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 赵美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Chew Mee.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.37,0:46:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.91,0:46:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解到我的惊讶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand my surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.42,0:46:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为大家了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.42,0:46:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不见面 斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were never to meet, Mr. Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.80,0:46:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总以为你的特征只是个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought your abnormality was a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.13,0:46:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些邪教相信 这是刀枪不入\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are cults where it is considered a sign of invulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.68,0:46:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,和高超的性能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and great sexual prowess.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.14,0:46:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经习惯了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've learned to live with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.85,0:46:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.02,0:46:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.98,0:46:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识这个人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know the gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.65,0:46:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he knows you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.61,0:46:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我大胆地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without being immodest,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.78,0:46:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界这一端没有人不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's hardly anyone in this part of the world who doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.95,0:46:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有很少人没听过邦德的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are very few people who haven't heard of Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.28,0:46:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国特务情报员007有特权杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}British Secret Service, 007, licensed to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.00,0:47:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使以我的标准来说 他非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good, even by my standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.16,0:47:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到过露臀夜总会附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was near the Bottoms Up Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.71,0:47:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}A coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.63,0:47:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.05,0:47:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙很危险 他知道一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's a menace. He knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.84,0:47:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我再付一百万消灭他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you suggesting I invest another million to remove him?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.72,0:47:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要看你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.64,0:47:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.22,0:47:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you have chosen to meet me,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.77,0:47:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚来吃晚饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps you will dine here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.02,0:47:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣幸之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be deIighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.27,0:47:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么九点整\N{\fnArial\fs30}9: 00 then.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.06,0:47:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,凌波 送他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ling Po, see this gentleman out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.33,0:47:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我你见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me you saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.58,0:47:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至邀请我吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He even invited me to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.92,0:47:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必定发觉我使他心痒痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have found me quite titillating.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.52,0:48:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In due time, I shall be laid to rest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.94,0:48:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这充实、愉快 漫长的一生过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my mausoleum.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.07,0:48:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会躺在我的钞墓内安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}after a useful, happy, long life.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.12,0:48:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让邦德缩短它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I do not intend to allow Mr. Bond to shorten it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.00,0:48:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.13,0:48:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿跟你一起吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, you know I'd much rather have dinner with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.63,0:48:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白的 请你快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I understand, James. Please hurry back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.18,0:48:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽快致电你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ring as soon as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.55,0:48:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吃夜宵吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A midnight snack might be just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.64,0:48:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把酒保持冰冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep the wine properly chilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.64,0:48:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的都要暖暖的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everything else warm, I trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.19,0:48:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye-bye. - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.69,0:48:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的都要暖暖的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And everything else warm?"
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.16,0:49:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不介意 送我两个侄女一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't mind giving my nieces a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.54,0:49:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.50,0:49:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,海发正在途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hai Fat's is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.55,0:49:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放下她们后 再回这里守候着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drop the girls, come back here and hang around.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.98,0:49:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye-bye. - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.36,0:49:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是斯卡曼加\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.74,0:49:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,海发先生约了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fat is expecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.93,0:50:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「恐怖乐园」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Grislyland."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.08,0:50:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pleasant evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.71,0:51:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓他！快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.52,0:51:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.48,0:51:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在这里乱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.15,0:51:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.11,0:51:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,带邦德先生到学校去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Mr. Bond to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.30,0:52:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.84,0:52:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,舒服死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.21,0:54:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔希曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tashman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.22,0:55:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chula.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chula.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.59,0:55:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chula ！Chula ！Chula ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chula! Chula! Chula!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.77,0:55:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chula ！Chula ！Chula ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chula! Chula! Chula!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.25,0:56:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chula ！Chula ！Chula ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chula! Chula! Chula!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.80,0:56:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.17,0:56:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我在此？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.38,0:56:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是海发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hai Fat owns this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.44,0:57:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.91,0:57:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘记告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.58,0:57:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们的父亲经营空手道学校的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their father runs a karate school.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.89,0:58:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.25,0:59:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这可算是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you might call a Mexican screw off, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.42,0:59:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮的小姐 一百铢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty lady. 100 baht.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.96,0:59:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,八十铢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. 80 baht.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.88,0:59:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十铢 漂亮的小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 baht, pretty lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.30,0:59:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的大象 五十铢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real elephant. 50 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.82,1:00:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大象 很便宜的 先生 一百铢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elephant. Bargain, mister. 100 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.24,1:00:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大象 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elephant. Real elephant.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.29,1:00:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十铢\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.96,1:00:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很帅 四十铢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are very handsome man. 40 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.38,1:00:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你个特价 二十铢\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, mister, 20 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.67,1:00:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你能使东西开快些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what, sonny, I'll give you 20, 000 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.80,1:00:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就给你二万铢\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you can make this heap go any faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.06,1:00:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,二万铢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}20, 000 baht.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.39,1:00:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我要欠你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'll have to owe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.31,1:00:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,死游客！二万铢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody tourist! 20, 000 baht!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.67,1:01:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂有此理 你这污水猪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn little brown water hog!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.34,1:01:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 JW？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what's the matter, J.W., hon?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.84,1:01:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试在我的地方这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just try that in my bayou, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.84,1:01:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连你的屁股也扯掉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd haul your ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.36,1:01:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,JW 看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, J.W.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.32,1:01:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想买一只那些可爱小象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gotta have me one of those cute little elephants.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.78,1:01:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,象！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elephant?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.83,1:01:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是支持民主党的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're Democrats, Maybelle.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.25,1:01:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫那些尖头怪脱下睡衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you got your little pointy heads out of them pajamas,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.05,1:01:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不会迟到上班！\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't be late for work!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.08,1:02:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早已料到！\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.W. : I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.37,1:02:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些尖头怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pointy-heads has no more idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.38,1:02:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,比信天翁的交通控制概念\N{\fnArial\fs30}of traffic control.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.04,1:02:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要差！\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a goony bird!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.72,1:02:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别将你的鼻子 伸进我的裤子里 听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your cotton-picking schnoz out of my pants. Hear, now?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.41,1:03:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy. You is ugly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.50,1:03:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,JW啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.W.?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.42,1:03:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.79,1:03:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那学校教什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they teach in that school?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.16,1:03:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭蕾舞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ballet dancing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.88,1:03:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得让邦德逃走很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find nothing remotely amusing about Mr. Bond's escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.76,1:03:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你低估他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You underestimated him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.22,1:03:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我的影响力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even my influence doesn't extend.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.01,1:03:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也伸展不到英国特工处\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the British Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.43,1:03:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall lie low, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.05,1:04:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会搞坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't intend to jeopardize the project.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.18,1:04:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投资了一半财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which I've invested half my fortune.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.18,1:04:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,并会赚数十亿的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it's ready to yieId billions.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.56,1:04:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在哪里躲藏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will you hide out?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.27,1:04:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does not concern you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.94,1:04:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.48,1:04:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他还给厂房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return it to the plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.86,1:04:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我的准许别离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and don't leave there without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.03,1:04:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒你 你是替我工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I remind you that you work for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.33,1:04:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我雇用你做初级合伙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took you on as a junior partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.29,1:04:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是偶尔可以被利用一下罢了 没什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be an occasional convenience, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.08,1:04:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是聘用你来管我的事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not hire you to interfere in my affairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.92,1:04:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that clearly understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.09,1:04:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Very clearly.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.72,1:04:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至开始后悔考虑聘请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now regret having even considered employing your services.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.93,1:04:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过先别说这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that is beside the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.10,1:04:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德不知道你在曼谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond doesn't know you're in Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.89,1:04:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从没见过你 但他认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never seen you. But he knows me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.93,1:04:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.19,1:04:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.04,1:05:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.38,1:05:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,海发先生刚刚辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fat has just resigned.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.96,1:05:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是新董事主席\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the new chairman of the board.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.01,1:05:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一向都喜欢那个钞墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always did like that mausoleum.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.81,1:05:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他埋在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.83,1:05:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 都是赫副官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that, darling. It was Hip.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.70,1:05:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没海发的影踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still no sign of Hai Fat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.83,1:05:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有查询都受到东方式的婉拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every inquiry gets a polite Oriental brush-off.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.33,1:05:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬赠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With compliments.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.29,1:05:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,「培约」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Phuyuck"?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.00,1:05:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是1974年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'74, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.30,1:06:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I approve.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.10,1:06:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.89,1:06:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是指酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not the wine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.02,1:06:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的连衣裙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your frock.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.44,1:06:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,适当的位置紧身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tight in all the right places.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.02,1:06:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,钮扣不太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too many buttons.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.65,1:06:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,东南亚的标准制服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard uniform for Southeast Asia.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.57,1:06:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,钮扣在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The buttons are down the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.28,1:06:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是由「Q」设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Designed by Q, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.03,1:06:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一颗定是自杀药丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them's a suicide pill, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.62,1:06:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那钮扣内置自动引导装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but the bottom one has a homer in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.95,1:06:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有原创力\N{\fnArial\fs30}How original.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.17,1:06:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.71,1:06:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}To this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.30,1:06:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和为将来的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the moment yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.68,1:06:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们这行业 恐怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}In our profession, I'm afraid,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.39,1:06:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法指望那一刻来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never can count on that moment to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.06,1:06:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,天晓得明年这个时候 你与我在何方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows where you and I will be this time next year?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.07,1:06:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是天各一方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Opposite sides of the worId, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.74,1:07:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,相距太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too far apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.16,1:07:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果赫副官找不到线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if Hip doesn't come up with a lead,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.78,1:07:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们就没有什么要办\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's really nothing very much for us to do tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.92,1:07:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者有呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.29,1:07:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你使我心痒痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, darling, I'm tempted.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.71,1:07:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没兴趣花几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But killing a few hours as one of your passing fancies.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.89,1:07:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来打发你的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't quite my scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.30,1:08:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,培约\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Phuyuck."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.32,1:08:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 真叫人意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Goodnight, what a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.82,1:08:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那「难以得手」的表现 很短促吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hard-to-get act didn't last very long, did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.78,1:08:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受过训练应付特如其来的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trained to expect the unexpected,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.54,1:08:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们没有教我应付 你穿着睡衣的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they never prepared me for anything like you in a nightie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.14,1:08:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为这件事永不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, I thought this wouId never happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.23,1:09:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么使你改变主意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.69,1:09:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意志薄弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.95,1:09:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.76,1:09:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,安黛拉小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Anders.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.43,1:09:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿上衣服我认不出你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't recognize you with your cIothes on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.43,1:09:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收买侍者让我进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bribed the bellboy to let me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.18,1:09:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想来警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.77,1:09:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.64,1:09:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常都是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I usually am.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.90,1:09:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我用三个枕头的旧把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I use the old three-pillow trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.90,1:09:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请相信我 我冒险到来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please believe me. I'm risking my life to come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.78,1:09:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在乎我的安危令人感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your concern for my well-being is touching.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.07,1:09:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也使我迷惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but puzzles me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.58,1:09:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯卡曼加身在曼谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scaramanga is in Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.58,1:09:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也曾在香港 不过不是追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in Hong Kong, too, but not after me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.45,1:09:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through that routine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.54,1:10:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是猛兽 我讨厌他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a monster. I hate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.96,1:10:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then leave him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.67,1:10:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能对斯卡曼加一走了之\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't walk out on Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.97,1:10:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no place he wouldn't find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.47,1:10:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一个好律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a good lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.35,1:10:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要007\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.77,1:10:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为谁把刻上你号码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think sent that bullet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.94,1:10:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹寄去伦敦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to London with your number on it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.73,1:10:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.98,1:10:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的指纹印在 那纸条上很不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it wasn't easy getting his fingerprint on the note.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.66,1:10:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我理解力迟钝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll forgive me if I've been a little slow on the uptake.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.74,1:10:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白你是世上 唯一可把他杀死的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see you're the only man in the world who can kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.12,1:10:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你有那个想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What gives you that idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.13,1:10:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯卡曼加对你的观感\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way Scaramanga speaks about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.38,1:10:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至蛮喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even has a likeness of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.13,1:10:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是过奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.30,1:10:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.31,1:11:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个价钱 什么都可以 我会付给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name your price. Anything. I'll pay it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.31,1:11:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你喜欢 你也可得到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have me, too, if you Iike.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.03,1:11:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也蛮有吸引力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not unattractive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.49,1:11:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码 你开始说出真相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last you're starting to tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.08,1:11:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我梦想你释放我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've dreamed about you setting me free.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.17,1:11:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直梦想 那个太阳能感应震动器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been dreaming about a solex agitator.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.64,1:11:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有听过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever heard of one?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.64,1:11:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你也可得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you can have that, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.20,1:12:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的衣服在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my clothes are in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.29,1:12:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要宰掉那女人！- 晚一点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll kill that woman. - Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.94,1:12:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.62,1:12:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄出那子弹是个妙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an inspiration sending that bullet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.92,1:13:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.46,1:13:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是两片连映\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a double feature.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.97,1:13:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.47,1:13:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,放好手饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting my jewelry away.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.66,1:14:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.82,1:14:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在几点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.16,1:14:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,两点\N{\fnArial\fs30}2: 00-ish.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.66,1:14:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,两点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}2: 00?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.50,1:14:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我躲在这里两个小时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mean I've been in here for two hours?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.79,1:14:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是职责的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in the line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.83,1:14:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,职责！我明早辞职了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duty? I'm resigning in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.84,1:14:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我们失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Goodnight, come on, don't let us down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.01,1:14:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工处需要像你这样的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Service needs women like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.51,1:14:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很明显你不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, obviously you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.30,1:14:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.35,1:14:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你会轮到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn will come, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.60,1:14:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要她把那仪器带来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as she brings me that solex.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.06,1:14:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为杀斯卡曼加？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For killing Scaramanga?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.90,1:14:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她首先替我拿到 太阳能感应震动器\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she gets me the solex agitator first.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.40,1:14:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先？\N{\fnArial\fs30}First?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.53,1:14:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 别乱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, you must be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.86,1:14:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.16,1:14:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我下次见到她时就会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find out about that the next time I meet her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.45,1:14:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已在安排了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's making the arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.25,1:15:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm Iate.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.50,1:15:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼谷的交通很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bangkok traffic's worse than Piccadilly.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.46,1:15:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经联络过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's made contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.84,1:15:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个帅哥好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the charm boy doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.05,1:15:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用你问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need you ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.59,1:15:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet you outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.64,1:15:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有把它带来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.84,1:16:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它留在你手提包内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, I left it in your handbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.25,1:16:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定在里面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be in here somewhere, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.63,1:16:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到店内那男人给了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the man in the shop give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.01,1:16:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有那张票 我们不能在海关拿到收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the ticket, we can't get a receipt for customs.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.97,1:16:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找不到的了 我在你来之前已看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't find it in there, Mr. Bond. I looked before you came.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.47,1:16:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that either.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.81,1:16:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.14,1:16:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,低一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.27,1:16:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,花生袋里的手枪 真有创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gun and a bag of peanuts. How original.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.53,1:16:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will they think of next?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.20,1:16:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫做斯卡曼加\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.37,1:16:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗斯科斯卡曼加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francisco Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.16,1:16:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是认识你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel I know you,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.45,1:16:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我从没想过我们会见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}although I never thought we should ever really meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.00,1:16:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是我的荣幸 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a very great pleasure for me, Mr. Bond,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.92,1:16:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全赖安黛拉小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks to Miss Anders.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.42,1:17:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表示感激的方法真特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've a strange way of showing your gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.00,1:17:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一妇不能侍二主\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mistress cannot serve two masters.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.84,1:17:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛心的一枪 但十分感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}A difficult shot, but most gratifying.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.05,1:17:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都各自玩得痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we all get our jollies one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.01,1:17:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的喜好一直是枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine have always been guns, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.89,1:17:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿时在马戏团中长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a boy, I was brought up in a circus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.15,1:17:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一的朋友是一只非洲大象\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only real friend was a magnificent African bull elephant.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.19,1:17:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天他的训练员虐待他 他发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day his handler mistreated him and he went berserk.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.70,1:17:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,流血 将要死时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bleeding, dying,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.20,1:17:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he came and found me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.00,1:17:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,单脚站立 这是他的绝招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stood on one leg, his best trick,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.92,1:17:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我提起放在他背上\N{\fnArial\fs30}picked me up and put me on his back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.67,1:17:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙用枪射他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man emptied the gun into his eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.18,1:17:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用我的手枪向他还以颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I emptied my stage pistol into his.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.51,1:17:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,以眼还眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}An eye for an eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.47,1:17:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,花生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nut?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.23,1:18:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 我一直以为自己喜欢动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Mr. Bond, I always thought I liked animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.23,1:18:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我发现我更喜欢杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I discovered that I liked killing people even more.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.41,1:18:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,保管它 无论如何别掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep this. Whatever you do, don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.96,1:18:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回去帮詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get back to help James.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.50,1:18:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了状况吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's gone wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.63,1:18:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个侏儒用枪指着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a midget with a gun on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.04,1:18:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,侏儒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A midget?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.71,1:18:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我在露臀夜总会外见到的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same one I saw outside the Bottoms Up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.30,1:18:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩死了 通知警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the girl is dead. Call the poIice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.81,1:18:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管这个女孩 她可以被取代的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the girl. She's repIaceable.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.10,1:18:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会查看她偷了我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall find what she stole from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.94,1:18:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你没有敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, I've got nothing against you, Mr. Bond,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.94,1:18:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我们不会再有任何瓜葛\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let us hope our paths never cross again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.77,1:18:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't try to follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.69,1:18:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个拿花生的朋友不会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your peanut-toting friend back there wouldn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.99,1:18:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.71,1:19:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要试我的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to try one of mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.64,1:19:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那太阳能感应器呢？- 给了晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the solex? - I gave it to Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.31,1:19:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么她在哪？- 在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And where's Goodnight? - Outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.51,1:19:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定是在车旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must be by the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.25,1:20:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人啊 给我通话器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women. Walkie-talkie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.55,1:20:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.72,1:20:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被锁在行李厢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody locked me in a boot.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.55,1:20:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.72,1:20:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被锁在那侏儒的车内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The midget's car. I'm locked in.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.68,1:20:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子是古铜色的 车顶黑色 车牌7543\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bronze car with a black roof, number 7543.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.90,1:20:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 车钥匙！- 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The keys. - I haven't got them.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.07,1:20:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.57,1:21:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 车钥匙呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, where are the car keys?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.45,1:21:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我手上 那太阳能感应器也在我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the keys. And I've got the solex, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.62,1:21:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,计程车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.08,1:21:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别逃 我们看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in there, Goodnight. We've got you spotted.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.30,1:21:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,计程车 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}HIP: Taxi! Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.94,1:21:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以示范一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a demonstration, boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.57,1:21:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.71,1:21:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.09,1:22:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know you!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.14,1:22:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.51,1:22:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那情报员！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're that secret agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.56,1:22:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自英国特工处的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That English secret agent from England.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.99,1:22:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在追着某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're chasing somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.53,1:22:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次要追谁？共产党员？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you after this time, boy? Commies?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.28,1:22:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.53,1:22:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全力支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.13,1:22:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh! I think we've got trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.52,1:22:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下你们的车 你们这些黄种尖头怪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull your cars over, you little brown pointy-heads!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.86,1:23:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警察！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a peace officer!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.11,1:23:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在吗？詹姆斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, are you still there? James?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.70,1:23:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到吗？詹姆斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me? James!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.54,1:23:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Goodnight. Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.08,1:23:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that? It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.84,1:23:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是总部 - 让我跟他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's headquarters. - Let me talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.30,1:23:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是路易斯安那州 警察局的佩帕警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. This is Sheriff J.W. Pepper, Louisiana State Police.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.13,1:23:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我那身在纳里饭店的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you call my wife at the Narai Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.14,1:23:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有任务在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell her I'm on a mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.14,1:23:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被委任做代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been deputized.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.81,1:23:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗？对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.77,1:23:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要追哪辆车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which car are we all chasing, boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.13,1:24:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.35,1:24:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那堆废铁驶离马路！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that piece of junk off the road!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.42,1:25:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去了左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went to the left, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.85,1:25:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press that pedal, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.03,1:25:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到底去了哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell they got to?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.38,1:26:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出错了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You goofed, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.39,1:26:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的桥在两里后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearest bridge is two miles back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.07,1:26:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！你在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.W. : God damn! What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.12,1:26:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？你想做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? What the hell you doing now, boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.91,1:26:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥在那边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bridge is that way!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.25,1:26:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not thinking of...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.21,1:26:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure am, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.51,1:26:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有听过亡命特技人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever heard of Evel Knievel?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.03,1:27:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没试过这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never done that before!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.44,1:27:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我也没试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, neither have I, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.84,1:28:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去对付他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go get them, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.63,1:28:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要管 这是我的部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay put, boy. This is my department.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.05,1:28:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有这能耐真好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to see you boys are on the ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.93,1:29:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是路易斯安那州 警察局的佩帕警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff J.W. Pepper, Louisiana State Police.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.26,1:29:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的身份证明 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my identification.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.97,1:29:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,执法联会 美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Law Enforcement Association, American Legion.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.43,1:29:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与我的搭挡在执行秘密任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my partner here, we're on a secret mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.85,1:29:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What the hell you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.36,1:29:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱包还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Give me my wallet back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.25,1:29:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.45,1:30:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以这么做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.W. : You can't do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.16,1:30:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱包还给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my wallet back!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.79,1:30:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开这手铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take these goddamn bracelets off!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.92,1:30:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告你们错误拘捕 警察施暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna sue ya for false arrest, police brutality!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.21,1:30:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有熟人的！我叫联邦调查局 和中情局教训你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got connections! I'm gonna get the FBI on your ass, the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.63,1:30:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂有此理 我要找季辛吉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it, I'm gonna get Henry Kissinger!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.51,1:30:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 我在跟你讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me when I'm talking to ya, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.77,1:30:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.94,1:30:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些尖头怪从没见过飞机吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't none of you pointy-heads ever seen an airplane before?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.82,1:30:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你还在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James? James, are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.66,1:30:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到吗？我想车已经停下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me? I think we've stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.26,1:31:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要报告的就是这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is really all there is to report, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.52,1:31:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我没听错 斯卡曼加已经逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if I heard correctly, Scaramanga got away.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.85,1:31:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.06,1:31:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭一辆长了翅膀的汽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a car that sprouted wings.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.11,1:31:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那绝对可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's perfectly feasible, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.98,1:31:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也正在研究这样的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, we're working on one now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.61,1:31:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Q, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.20,1:31:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安在行李厢 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Miss Goodnight was in the boot. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.20,1:31:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆飞机汽车被扔弃在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the car-plane abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.95,1:31:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼谷以西二百里的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}about 200 miles west of Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.66,1:31:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那太阳能感应器呢？- 在晚安的手袋内\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the solex? - In Goodnight's handbag, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.21,1:31:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚安现在在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Goodnight now?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.50,1:31:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.09,1:31:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯系统接收不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Communications aren't picking up the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.21,1:31:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,引导装置的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the homer she has, supplied by Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.30,1:31:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话！他们只是没把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rubbish! They're simply not stepping up…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.63,1:31:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,接收率提高\N{\fnArial\fs30}the reception sufficiently to enable.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.72,1:31:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.76,1:31:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是混乱无能的运作！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the fouled-up, half-witted operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.98,1:31:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}M: What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.06,1:31:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接收到晚安的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've picked up Goodnight's signal, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.35,1:31:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's something.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.44,1:31:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有些颇奇怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is something rather curious, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.19,1:32:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our sector's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.11,1:32:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're receiving her signal from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.03,1:32:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自这里离岸的某地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}off this coastline off shore here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.37,1:32:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一张是较大的比例\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, here it is on a much larger scale.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.00,1:32:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.20,1:32:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这群小岛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this group of small islands.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.12,1:32:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们需要的 中国共产党水域\N{\fnArial\fs30}M: That's all we need, Red Chinese waters.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.96,1:32:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以当疏忽迷路闯了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we could stray inadvertently into them, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.30,1:32:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以飞在他们雷达 侦测范围以下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could fly low under their radar screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.26,1:32:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.09,1:32:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果首相知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the PM gets to hear of this,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.01,1:32:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会把我吊死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll hang me from the yardarm.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.43,1:32:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,正式来说 你什么也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officially, you won't know a thing about it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.43,1:33:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一架小型海上飞机飞近你的岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a small seaplane approaching your island.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.85,1:33:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我们采取行动吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want us to take any action?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.02,1:33:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 请什么也不要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, please don't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.11,1:34:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是一个我等着来的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's a guest I'm expecting.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.57,1:34:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他不会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he won't be leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.28,1:35:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尼拿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Nick Nack.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.70,1:35:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢1962年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer the '62 myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.25,1:35:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过总比一包花生味道要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, beats a bag of peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.54,1:35:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯卡曼加先生会亲自欢迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Scaramanga will welcome you personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.84,1:35:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.59,1:35:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现很不得体 但我无法抗拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vulgar display, but I couldn't resist it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.85,1:35:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为再见到你太高兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I am so delighted to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.18,1:36:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没杀伤力的玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}A harmless toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.64,1:36:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看到 我是完全没有携械的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, as you can see now, completeIy unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.81,1:36:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,香烟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.65,1:36:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有许多相同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have so much in common, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.32,1:36:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多事讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have so much to discuss,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.65,1:36:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来不再有这个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will never have this opportunity again.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.03,1:36:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的职业是最孤独的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ours is the loneliest profession,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.82,1:36:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们共聚数小时吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let us spend a few pleasant hours together.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.24,1:36:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如何能拒绝这样殷勤的邀请？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I refuse such a gracious invitation?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.91,1:36:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid. Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.37,1:36:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼拿克 我期望你有超水准表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick Nack, I expect you to surpass yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.54,1:36:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一流名厨\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a Cordon Bleu, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.09,1:36:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是了 晚安小姐在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, where's Miss Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.34,1:36:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这儿附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.76,1:36:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没办法离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way for her to leave,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.01,1:36:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是行动自如的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she does as she pleases.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.89,1:36:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢我的岛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like my island?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.02,1:36:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点偏僻 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bit off the beaten track, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.93,1:36:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是免费出租的 我偶尔给我的房东些恩惠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's rent-free. I do my landlords an occasional favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.65,1:36:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很布置的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cozy arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.86,1:36:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,聘请佣人麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Servant problem, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.32,1:36:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.90,1:36:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼拿克很称职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick Nack does for me very nicely.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.86,1:36:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常只有我俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually there's just the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.37,1:37:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过客人到来也很方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}but having guests is no inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.95,1:37:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自给自足\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're entirely self-supporting.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.37,1:37:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有你能想到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have every electrical laborsaving device.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.12,1:37:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,省电的装置都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could possibIy think of.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.37,1:37:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一间密封室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an air lock, as you are doubtless aware.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.17,1:37:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是自动化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Automatic, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.76,1:37:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我们这里有充足电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally, we have an ample supply of electricity here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.93,1:37:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.45,1:37:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里应该可以供电 给几只电动牙刷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should run a few electric toothbrushes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.28,1:37:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.54,1:37:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿就是太阳能源站\N{\fnArial\fs30}A solar energy station.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.71,1:37:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是关于它的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is what it's all about.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.25,1:37:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,热电发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thermoelectric generators to convert.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.42,1:37:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,将太阳能转化为电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}solar energy into electricity.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.42,1:38:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是由海发建筑公司建造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All built by Hai Fat's construction company, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.30,1:38:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我继承了他的企业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow I seem to have inherited it from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.97,1:38:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是全自动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all fully automated.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.85,1:38:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是克拉 看管一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Kra, maintenance and security.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.52,1:38:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,若尼拿克不是在擦亮银器时\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks after everything in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.89,1:38:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会做其余的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick Nack does everything else when he isn't polishing the silver.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.56,1:38:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说电力储藏在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell me the electricity is stored in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.61,1:38:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学站始终不是我的长处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science was never my strong point.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.20,1:38:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,超导电线圈 被液化氦冷却\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superconductivity coils cooled by liquid helium.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.16,1:38:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我是你就不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I wouldn't stick my finger,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.99,1:38:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手指插进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anything else for that matter, in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.62,1:38:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在零下453度\N{\fnArial\fs30}At 453 degrees below zero,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.00,1:38:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,液体氦气 会像折冰柱般折断它\N{\fnArial\fs30}that liquid helium would break it off like an icicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.79,1:38:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然比我知道多许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really know far more about it than I do, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.63,1:38:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在请求每个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm arranging for every country that can afford the price.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.09,1:38:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,派专家到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to send their experts here to see for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.55,1:38:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要直到收到钱 才有那太阳能感应器 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no solex until the money is in the bank. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.64,1:38:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.72,1:38:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经历过类似的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have run across similar situations.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.39,1:38:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有像我这里的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what I've got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.23,1:38:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高竞投者可兴建\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way the highest bidder can build.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.19,1:38:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,数百个站\N{\fnArial\fs30}hundreds of these stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.48,1:38:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再出售数百个特许经营权\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sell franchises for hundreds more.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.36,1:39:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会赚得荷包满满的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will literally have the sun in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.82,1:39:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳能的独家经营\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monopoly on solar power.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.28,1:39:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,石油酋长会收买你 以防止你把太阳能推出市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oil sheiks will pay you just to keep solar energy off the market.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.70,1:39:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这样想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thought had occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.92,1:39:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是收集的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the collection point.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.64,1:39:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它被放置的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. So that's where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.27,1:39:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在热交换器的太阳能感应器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our famous solex in the still down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.32,1:39:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把热力输送到发热器\N{\fnArial\fs30}transmits heat to the thermal generators.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.99,1:39:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过这个收集的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's collected through this?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.91,1:39:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过从何收集？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where is it collected from?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.62,1:39:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.20,1:40:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着那蘑菇型的石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch that mushroom-shaped rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.02,1:40:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很巧妙 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ingenious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.56,1:40:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把面板锁定太阳的位置 然后它自动追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The panels lock on to the sun and then track it automatically.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.98,1:40:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.20,1:40:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.36,1:40:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些面板必须要制造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reflected through this, those panels must produce a heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.28,1:40:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少华氏3500度的热力\N{\fnArial\fs30}of at least 3, 500 degrees Fahrenheit.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.33,1:40:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这样说 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.87,1:40:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可在任何地方把能源集中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do know that we can focus the power wherever we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.54,1:40:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这边 我给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here. I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.01,1:41:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是额外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.34,1:41:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,连太阳能感应器一起发售 不另收费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes with the solex. No extra charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.66,1:41:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢这部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the part I really like.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.88,1:41:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我所称的太阳能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's what I call solar power.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.80,1:41:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我称这做麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I call trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.68,1:41:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得承认 我是不折不扣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must admit, Mr. Bond, I am now undeniably.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.31,1:41:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,金枪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Man with the Golden Gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.02,1:42:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,午餐时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.79,1:42:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.00,1:42:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Miss Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.67,1:42:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.84,1:42:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是穿得太讲究吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we a little overdressed, Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.84,1:42:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢女孩穿比基尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like a girl in a bikini.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.68,1:42:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会隐藏武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}No concealed weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.43,1:42:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安小姐 请坐 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Goodnight, please. Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.64,1:42:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看尼拿克为我们准备了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's see what Nick Nack has for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.56,1:42:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蘑菇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.44,1:42:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,炒蘑菇似乎很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fried mushroom looks terribly interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.36,1:42:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也留意到 我晚点再吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I noticed that. I'll get around to it later.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.12,1:42:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳下好玩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having fun in the sun, Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.95,1:42:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.12,1:42:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以永远留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could stay here forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.29,1:43:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.30,1:43:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.42,1:43:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像1934年的慕东\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slightly reminiscent of a '34 Mouton.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.22,1:43:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我一定要把它加在酒窖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I must add it to my cellar.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.18,1:43:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的生活真写意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live well, Scaramanga.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.06,1:43:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次交易都得一百万 这让我负担得起\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a million dollars a contract, I can afford to, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.27,1:43:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为一小点金钱工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work for peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.81,1:43:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只获得英女皇一句由衷的赞赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hearty "well done" from Her Majesty the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.15,1:43:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,和少量的退休金\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a pittance of a pension.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.65,1:43:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外我们都是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from that, we are the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.45,1:43:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们干一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To us, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.66,1:43:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是最出色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.91,1:43:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个很有用的形容词\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a useful four-letter word,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.20,1:43:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,形容你很贴切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're full of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.79,1:43:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀人时 都是按政府给我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I kill, it's on the specific orders of my government.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.00,1:43:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我杀的都是杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those I kill are themselves killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.01,1:43:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come, come, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.80,1:43:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.01,1:43:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认你杀人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get as much fulfillment out of killing as I do,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.09,1:43:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我一样很有满足感吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why don't you admit it?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.43,1:43:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认杀你会很满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admit killing you would be a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.97,1:43:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最初见到我时就应杀掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've done that when you first saw me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.85,1:43:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国人不认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then of course the English don't consider it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.35,1:44:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷血杀人有风度\N{\fnArial\fs30}sporting to kill in cold blood, do they?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.60,1:44:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别指望这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't count on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.70,1:44:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可在你登陆时射杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've shot you down when you landed.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.58,1:44:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最不费劲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that would've been ridiculously easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.92,1:44:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像每个伟大的艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Mr. Bond, like every great artist,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.67,1:44:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在人生中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to create an indisputable.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.88,1:44:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,创一次丰功伟绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}masterpiece once in my Iifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.47,1:44:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,007之死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death of 007,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.68,1:44:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}face to face,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.64,1:44:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利将属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.10,1:44:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指装饰和展览 你这个石制壁炉架？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, stuffed and displayed over your rocky mantelpiece?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.40,1:44:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个主意很有趣 但我是以历史作考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an amusing idea, but I was thinking in terms of history.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.40,1:44:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个巨人的决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A duel between titans.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.36,1:44:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的金枪对你的沃尔达PPK\N{\fnArial\fs30}My golden gun against your Walther PPK.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.83,1:44:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家机会均等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of us with a 50-50 chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.58,1:45:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我六颗子弹对你一颗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six bullets to your one?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.08,1:45:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要一颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only need one.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.75,1:45:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听来有点老套吧 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds a bit oId-fashioned, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.00,1:45:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 黎明时份决斗的那种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, pistols at dawn, that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.09,1:45:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, it is, Mr. Bond,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.76,1:45:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这仍是男子汉的最好考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it still remains the only true test for gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.81,1:45:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你没资格取得胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt if you qualify on that score.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.02,1:45:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我接受你挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, I accept.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.19,1:45:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我先吃掉尼拿克\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I finish this delicious lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.61,1:45:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们弄的美味午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Nick Nack has prepared for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.28,1:45:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 让我提醒你们 这是生死决战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Messieurs, I will remind you this is un duella mort.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.87,1:45:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有其中一人可离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one of you can leave the fieId of honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.87,1:45:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果需要最后一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a coup de grce is necessary,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.12,1:45:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为裁判的我会亲自操刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}as your referee, I will administer it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.21,1:45:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预料没有损伤 要干净利落的一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not expect wounds. Only a clean kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.47,1:45:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我指挥下\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.47,1:45:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,双方要退后二十步\N{\fnArial\fs30}each contestant will take 20 paces.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.56,1:46:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？斯卡曼加先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready, Monsieur Scaramanga?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.81,1:46:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.86,1:46:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 邦德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready, Monsieur Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.27,1:46:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.61,1:46:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始数了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will now begin the count.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.99,1:46:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四 五\N{\fnArial\fs30}1, 2, 3, 4, 5,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.99,1:46:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,六 七 八 九\N{\fnArial\fs30}6, 7, 8, 9,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.66,1:46:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,十 十一 十二 十三\N{\fnArial\fs30}10, 11, 12, 13,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.21,1:46:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,十四 十五 十六\N{\fnArial\fs30}14, 15, 16,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.67,1:46:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,十七 十八 十九 二十！\N{\fnArial\fs30}17, 18, 19, 20!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.89,1:47:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you kill him,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.76,1:47:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一切都是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all this be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.06,1:47:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 到这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, Monsieur Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.06,1:48:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,射得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur, good shooting.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.89,1:48:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没杀过侏儒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never killed a midget before,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.27,1:48:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过凡事总有第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there can always be a first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.77,1:48:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.02,1:49:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只剩下三颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only have three bullets left!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.70,1:49:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我耍你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fooled you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.36,1:53:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 - 詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodnight. - James!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.62,1:53:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.87,1:53:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇定点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady, Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.95,1:53:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.25,1:53:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,毙命在最后一击下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flat on his coup de grce.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.50,1:53:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这鬼地方 和找出那个太阳能感应器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get out of this fun palace and find that solex.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.85,1:53:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.22,1:53:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去对付那维修工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of the maintenance man.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.85,1:53:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already did.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.85,1:53:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他冷僵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I laid him out cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.77,1:53:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.90,1:53:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不如外表看来那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more to you than meets the eye, Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.62,1:54:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想问愚蠢的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, I hate to ask stupid questions,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.75,1:54:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但究竟你是在哪里弄死他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but where exactly did you knock him cold?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.17,1:54:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他掉在那个池内\N{\fnArial\fs30}He landed in that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.79,1:54:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不信告示的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you believe in signs?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.30,1:54:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的体温 让氦气提升到零度以上之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got about five minutes before his.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.13,1:54:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还剩下大约五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}body temperature raises that helium well above zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.26,1:54:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着这整个地方就会爆炸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this whole damn place will go sky high.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.80,1:54:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起！我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.80,1:55:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉那道光！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the beam!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.39,1:55:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,按撤销主按钮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the master override switch!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.48,1:55:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.73,1:55:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.48,1:55:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.56,1:55:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,留心听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.07,1:55:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有个操纵台\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a console up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.61,1:55:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,必定有一个扫描连锁按钮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there must be a scanner interlock button on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.90,1:55:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,按它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push it!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.74,1:56:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.83,1:56:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该在辅助反馈电路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be on the auxiliary feedback circuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.79,1:56:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「电脑连锁」是这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer interlock. Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.42,1:56:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把每个都按下 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just push every damn button, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.77,1:56:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl, Goodnight. You've done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.98,1:56:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.49,1:57:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开 我拿到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, get the hell out of there! I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.65,1:57:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你会游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you can swim, Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.02,1:58:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.69,1:58:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的中式帆船就停在转角处\N{\fnArial\fs30}His junk is moored around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.97,1:59:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁掌舵的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, darling, who is at the wheel?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.35,1:59:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔治 - 乔治？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- George. - George?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.10,1:59:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Automatic pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.27,1:59:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应在八小时内 抵达香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should make Hong Kong in about eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.27,1:59:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,出入不会太大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give or take a littIe.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.55,1:59:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都想从中国乘一艘慢船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wanted to take a slow boat from China.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.14,2:00:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.51,2:00:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀死你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.10,2:00:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.69,2:01:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！等一下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.15,2:01:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.86,2:01:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你在干嘛呢？快点进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, what are you doing? Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.41,2:01:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.91,2:01:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法呼吸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.70,2:01:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.58,2:01:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会后悔的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.58,2:01:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然矮小 但我的记性很好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be small, but I never forget!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.92,2:01:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不放我出来我就杀掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you if you don't let me out of here! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.43,2:01:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出来！你这大坏蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out, you big bully!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.05,2:01:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,住口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.02,2:02:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎样处置他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do with him?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.94,2:02:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.02,2:02:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 不是吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.69,2:02:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I damn well did.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.32,2:02:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你已把玻璃清理好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got all the glass out of the bed, I trust.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.91,2:02:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想有别的东西妨碍我们 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want anything else to disturb our peace, do we?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.62,2:02:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 刚才到哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.00,2:02:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.68,2:02:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.27,2:02:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.15,2:02:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,找谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.48,2:02:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了 邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! There you are, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.86,2:02:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.95,2:02:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.12,2:03:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安小姐在吗？我想跟她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Miss Goodnight with you? I'd like a word with her.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.54,2:03:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.59,2:03:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德？你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond? Bond, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.09,2:03:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.01,2:03:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她快来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just coming, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.36,2:03:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.53,2:03:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodnight. - Good night, sir.
